        <mxCell id="stage1-items" value="• Git 签名提交&#xa;• Branch Protection&#xa;• Code Review (2人+)&#xa;• Pre-commit Hooks&#xa;• Secret Scanning&#xa;  - GitLeaks&#xa;  - TruffleHog&#xa;• Commit Signing (GPG)&#xa;&#xa;[Threats]&#xa;• 恶意代码注入&#xa;• 凭证泄露&#xa;• 未授权提交" style="text;fontSize=18;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontFamily=PingFang SC,Microsoft YaHei,Noto Sans SC,sans-serif;align=left;spacingLeft=5;spacingRight=5;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;" parent="1" vertex="1">
